### Sirāj API — click "Send Request" above each block (REST Client extension).
### Pick the environment once: Ctrl+Alt+E (Cmd+Alt+E on macOS) → "local". Start the server first (task 3).
###
### The database ships empty: domains, categories and questions are written in the
### admin console (/admin). The ids below — @domain, @game, @room… — are the ones
### your own data hands back, so send the request above them first.

### Health (#113)
GET {{base}}/health

### App config (#112)
GET {{base}}/config

### Start a guest session (#4) — copies the token into @token below automatically
# @name guest
POST {{base}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Malek", "client": "ios" }

###
@token = {{guest.response.body.data.token}}

### Current user (#11)
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Your domains (#114) — a new player starts with the flagship, if one is published
# @name mine
GET {{base}}/me/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept-Language: en

###
@domain = {{mine.response.body.data.0.id}}

### Explore every domain, in Arabic (#17, scope=all)
GET {{base}}/domains?scope=all&page=1&per_page=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept-Language: ar

### Search domains and categories (#21)
GET {{base}}/search?scope=all&q=tawhid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Domain detail (#18) and its categories (#19)
GET {{base}}/domains/{{domain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/domains/{{domain}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept-Language: fr

### One category (#20)
GET {{base}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a domain (#116) — playing in one adds it too
POST {{base}}/me/domains/{{domain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Replace and reorder (#115) — onboarding or Manage
PUT {{base}}/me/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "domain_ids": [{{domain}}], "source": "added" }

### Remove a domain (#117) — refused with 409 last_domain when it's the last one
DELETE {{base}}/me/domains/{{domain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Question of the day (#22)
GET {{base}}/daily-question
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a quick game (#24) — 422 no_questions until the bank has some
# @name game
POST {{base}}/games
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "quick", "domain_id": {{domain}} }

###
@game = {{game.response.body.data.id}}

### Game state (#25), 50/50 (#27), an answer (#26), finish (#29), results (#30)
GET {{base}}/games/{{game}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/games/{{game}}/fifty
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/games/{{game}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "position": 0, "choice": 1, "time_ms": 1200 }

###
POST {{base}}/games/{{game}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/games/{{game}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Host a live room (#36), then join it with the code (#38)
# @name room
POST {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "domain_id": {{domain}}, "question_count": 5, "seconds": 20, "max_players": 4 }

###
@room = {{room.response.body.data.code}}

### The lobby (#37), ready (#41), chat (#45, #44), start (#43), podium (#46)
GET {{base}}/rooms/{{room}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{room}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ready": true }

###
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{room}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "bismillah" }

###
POST {{base}}/rooms/{{room}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/rooms/{{room}}/podium
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Duels: queue (#47), state, stop searching (#48), ratings (#50)
POST {{base}}/duels/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "domain_id": {{domain}} }

###
GET {{base}}/duels/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{base}}/duels/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/me/duel-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Challenges: the three boxes (#51), the counts (#52), a new one (#53)
GET {{base}}/challenges?box=received
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/challenges/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/challenges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "friend_ids": [], "domain_id": {{domain}}, "question_count": 5, "seconds": 20, "days": 3, "message": "yalla" }

### A random opponent (#61) and a pass-the-device round (#62)
POST {{base}}/challenges/random-opponent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/local-rounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locals": ["Malek", "Yusuf"], "domain_id": {{domain}}, "question_count": 5, "seconds": 20 }

### Messages: the inbox (#75), a thread (#77), sending (#83), the badge
GET {{base}}/conversations?tab=people
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/conversations-candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/conversations-unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Progress (#90), mastery (#91), leaderboard (#95), notifications (#87)
GET {{base}}/me/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/me/mastery
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/leaderboards?period=week&scope=global
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The live stream (standing in for the WebSocket, #111): one line per signal
GET {{base}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sign out (#7)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
